Serve the OAuth callback before the connection token check.

Every extension sign-in ends with the identity provider redirecting the browser
to http://127.0.0.1:PORT/<product>/callback. On a desktop that request lands in
the same browser that has the workbench open, so it carries the vscode-tkn
cookie and the token check passes. On Android it does not. The provider is
opened in a Chrome Custom Tab, which uses the browser's own cookie jar and not
the app WebView's, so the callback arrives with no cookie at all. It carries no
token in the query either: the workbench mints this URL from window.location,
and the root handler strips the token from there before the workbench is ever
loaded.

So once a connection token is in force, the callback is answered 403 and the
flow stops without a word. callback.html never loads, which means the intent://
relay that 0006 adds to it never runs, vscodroid://callback never fires,
MainActivity.handleExtensionCallback is never called, and the extension waits
forever on a localStorage key that nothing will write. Nothing appears in the
workbench; the sign-in simply hangs. Measured on an API 36 emulator against the
tokenful server: /version answered 200, / answered 403, and
/callback?vscode-reqid=1 answered 403.

Serving it early costs nothing that was being protected. _handleCallback takes
only the response object, ignores the request entirely, and returns a static
callback.html; the only data the page acts on is the query the caller supplied
itself. What actually reaches the app is the vscodroid://callback intent, and
the manifest lets any app on the device fire that directly, so this route was
never the thing standing between an attacker and the workbench.

The literal '/callback' matches the '/version' and '/delay-shutdown' checks
directly above it, and is deliberately not webClientServer.ts's CALLBACK_PATH,
which is module-local there. It also leaves a fingerprint that survives
minification: === "/callback" appears nowhere in an unpatched bundle, where the
route is only ever compared against a hoisted constant.

diff --git a/src/vs/server/node/remoteExtensionHostAgentServer.ts b/src/vs/server/node/remoteExtensionHostAgentServer.ts
index e7ae07d..f9546ee 100644
